# --- Development self-signed Authenticode artifacts (NEVER commit) ----------
# Private-key containers and dev root/leaf exports must stay local to the
# signing workstation. The dev root is also git-ignored even as a public .cer
# because it is machine-specific and regenerated by the operator.
*.pfx
*.p12
PathVeerDevelopmentRootCA.cer
PathVeerDevCodeSign.cer
dev-signing-backup-*.pfx
